# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# Types:   feat fix refactor perf test docs build ci chore revert
# Scopes:  experimentation governance codebase evidence orchestration evaluation
#          shared-kernel platform api worker mcp web infra docs
#
# Subject: imperative mood, lower case, no trailing period, under 72 characters.
#          "add resource ceiling to experiment spec", not "added" or "adds".
#
# Body:    why the change was needed and what it affects. Wrap at 72 columns.
#          Skip it when the subject genuinely says everything.
#
# Footer:  "Refs: #12" or "Closes: #12".
#
# One logical change per commit. If the subject needs the word "and",
# it is probably two commits.
